div><div data-w-id="37e3d138-d5bc-0d43-ffb3-5c61f088c3c8" class="table-row cc-first"><div class="feature"><div class="feature-icon"><img src="images/web.svg" loading="lazy" width="266" alt="" class="skills-icons"/></div><div><h3>Web Design</h3><div>Responsive web design has been a mainstay in my work experience. I have revitalized old websites as well as worked with clients to build something new from scratch.</div></div></div></div><div data-w-id="22c32bb3-abeb-e0cb-564a-a761a13638c4" class="table-row"><div class="feature"><div class="feature-icon"><img src="images/design.svg" loading="lazy" width="242" alt="" class="skills-icons"/></div><div><h3>Identity &amp; Branding</h3><div>Having a recognizable and scalable identity is important! I have worked on many logos from emblem, wordmarks, and abstract. As well as branding assets from social media, stationary, and shipping essentials, to conference banners, table wraps, and more. </div></div></div></div><div class="table-row"><div class="feature"><div class="feature-icon"><img src="images/illustration.svg" loading="lazy" width="234" alt="" class="skills-icons"/></div><div><h3>Illustration</h3><div>Much of my illustration work has been a key supporting feature for my animation or branding work. I also receive commisions for various uses.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="about" class="section"><div class="container"><img src="images/circle.svg" loading="lazy" width="543" data-w-id="82980c96-69a6-2140-89d4-12edc8a2410a" alt="" class="notsvg-pink-bg-big bouncing"/><div id="About" class="grid-2-columns"><div id="w-node-_6ec2ab5d-3805-777c-39d1-b0de6d319fa6-0da5a823" class="div-block-8"><h2 class="display-3 margin-bottom-50">Heyo!</h2><img src="images/372583399_834834898004580.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px" srcset="images/372583399_834834898004580-p-500.png 500w, images/372583399_834834898004580.png 760w" alt="" class="rounded-img-about-section"/></div><div i